#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:2
msgid "Search query syntax"
msgstr "搜索查询语法"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:4
msgid ""
"When searching on Read the Docs with :doc:`server side search </server-side-"
"search/index>`, you can use some parameters in your query in order to search"
" on given projects, versions, or to get more accurate results."
msgstr ""
"在 Read the Docs 上使用 :doc:`服务器端搜索 </server-side-search/index>` "
"时，你可以在查询中使用一些参数，以搜索指定项目、版本或获得更精确的结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:9
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:11
msgid ""
"Parameters are in the form of ``name:value``, they can appear anywhere in "
"the query, and depending on the parameter, you can use one or more of them."
msgstr "参数形式为 ``name:value`` ，可出现在查询的任何位置，视参数而定可使用一个或多个。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:15
msgid ""
"Any other text that isn't a parameter will be part of the search query. If "
"you don't want your search term to be interpreted as a parameter, you can "
"escape it like ``project\\:docs``."
msgstr "任何非参数的其他文本都会成为搜索查询的一部分。若不希望搜索词被解释为参数，可像 ``project\\:docs`` 这样转义。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:21
msgid "Unknown parameters like ``foo:bar`` don't require escaping."
msgstr "像 ``foo:bar`` 这样的未知参数无需转义。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:23
msgid "The available parameters are:"
msgstr "可用参数如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:25
msgid "project"
msgstr "project"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:26
msgid ""
"Indicates the project and version to include results from (this doesn’t "
"include subprojects or translations). If the version isn’t provided, the "
"default version will be used. More than one parameter can be included."
msgstr "指明要包含结果的项目和版本（不包含子项目或翻译）。若未提供版本，则使用默认版本。可包含多个该参数。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:31
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:45
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:58
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:101
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:113
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:125
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:136
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:33
msgid "``project:docs test``"
msgstr "``project:docs test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:34
msgid "``project:docs/latest test``"
msgstr "``project:docs/latest test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:35
msgid "``project:docs/stable project:dev test``"
msgstr "``project:docs/stable project:dev test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:37
msgid "subprojects"
msgstr "subprojects"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:38
msgid ""
"Include results from the given project and its subprojects. If the version "
"isn't provided, the default version of all projects will be used. If a "
"version is provided, all subprojects matching that version will be included,"
" and if they don't have a version with that name, we use their default "
"version. More than one parameter can be included."
msgstr "包含给定项目及其子项目的结果。若未提供版本，则使用所有项目的默认版本。若提供了版本，则包含所有匹配该版本的子项目；若子项目没有同名版本，则使用其默认版本。可包含多个该参数。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:47
msgid "``subprojects:docs test``"
msgstr "``subprojects:docs test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:48
msgid "``subprojects:docs/latest test``"
msgstr "``subprojects:docs/latest test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:49
msgid "``subprojects:docs/stable subprojects:dev test``"
msgstr "``subprojects:docs/stable subprojects:dev test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:51
msgid "user"
msgstr "user"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:52
msgid ""
"Include results from projects the given user has access to. The only "
"supported value is ``@me``, which is an alias for the current user. Only one"
" parameter can be included. If duplicated, the last one will override the "
"previous one."
msgstr "包含给定用户有权访问的项目的结果。唯一支持的值为 ``@me`` ，即当前用户的别名。只能包含一个该参数；若重复出现，后者覆盖前者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:60
msgid "``user:@me test``"
msgstr "``user:@me test``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:63
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the user doesn’t have permission over one version, or if the version "
"doesn’t exist, we don’t include results from that version."
msgstr "若用户对某版本没有权限，或该版本不存在，我们不包含该版本的结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:68
msgid ""
"The API will return all the projects that were used in the final search, "
"with that information you can check which projects were used in the search."
msgstr "API 会返回最终搜索中用到的所有项目，据此你可以核对搜索使用了哪些项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:72
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:74
msgid ""
"In order to keep our search usable for everyone, you can search up to 100 "
"projects at a time. If the resulting query includes more than 100 projects, "
"they will be omitted from the final search."
msgstr "为保证搜索对所有人可用，你一次最多可搜索 100 个项目。若最终查询包含超过 100 个项目，超出部分会从最终搜索中省略。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:79
msgid ""
"This syntax is only available when using our search API V3 or when using the"
" global search (https://app.readthedocs.org/search/)."
msgstr "此语法仅在使用我们的搜索 API V3 或全局搜索（https://app.readthedocs.org/search/）时可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:82
msgid ""
"Searching multiple versions of the same project isn't supported, the last "
"version will override the previous one."
msgstr "不支持搜索同一项目的多个版本，后者会覆盖前者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:86
msgid "Special queries"
msgstr "特殊查询"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:88
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses the `Simple Query String`_ feature from `Elasticsearch`_."
" This means that as the search query becomes more complex, the results "
"yielded become more specific."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 使用 `Elasticsearch`_ 的 `Simple Query String`_ "
"功能。这意味着搜索查询越复杂，得到的结果越精确。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:96
msgid "Exact phrase search"
msgstr "精确短语搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:98
msgid ""
"If a query is wrapped in ``\"`` (double quotes), then only those results "
"where the phrase is exactly matched will be returned."
msgstr "若查询用 ``\"`` （双引号）包裹，则只返回短语完全匹配的结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:103
msgid "``\"custom css\"``"
msgstr "``\"custom css\"``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:104
msgid "``\"adding a subproject\"``"
msgstr "``\"adding a subproject\"``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:105
msgid "``\"when a 404 is returned\"``"
msgstr "``\"when a 404 is returned\"``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:108
msgid "Prefix query"
msgstr "前缀查询"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:110
msgid ""
"``*`` (asterisk) at the end of any term signifies a prefix query. It returns"
" the results containing the words with the specific prefix."
msgstr "任意词末尾的 ``*`` （星号）表示前缀查询，返回包含该前缀词语的结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:115
msgid "``test*``"
msgstr "``test*``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:116
msgid "``build*``"
msgstr "``build*``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:119
msgid "Fuzziness"
msgstr "模糊匹配"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:121
msgid ""
"``~N`` (tilde followed by a number) after a word indicates edit distance "
"(fuzziness). This type of query is helpful when the exact spelling of the "
"keyword is unknown. It returns results that contain terms similar to the "
"search term."
msgstr "词后跟 ``~N`` （波浪号加数字）表示编辑距离（模糊度）。当关键词确切拼写未知时此类查询很有用，返回包含与搜索词相近词语的结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:127
msgid "``doks~1``"
msgstr "``doks~1``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:128
msgid "``test~2``"
msgstr "``test~2``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:129
msgid "``getter~2``"
msgstr "``getter~2``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:132
msgid "Words close to each other"
msgstr "相近词语"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:134
msgid ""
"``~N`` (tilde followed by a number) after a phrase can be used to match "
"words that are near to each other."
msgstr "短语后跟 ``~N`` （波浪号加数字）可匹配彼此接近的词语。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:138
msgid "``\"dashboard admin\"~2``"
msgstr "``\"dashboard admin\"~2``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:139
msgid "``\"single documentation\"~1``"
msgstr "``\"single documentation\"~1``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/syntax.rst:140
msgid "``\"read the docs policy\"~5``"
msgstr "``\"read the docs policy\"~5``"

